{"id":"4c7014745c223904b817f46bc17b8d480031c1a2","axis":"silent","repo":"supabase/supabase","sha":"4c7014745c223904b817f46bc17b8d480031c1a2","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"apps/docs/components/Navigation/NavigationMenu/NavigationMenu.constants.ts","lines":["@@ -871,6 +871,7 @@ export const auth: NavMenuConstant = {","         { name: 'Auth0', url: '/guides/auth/third-party/auth0' },","         { name: 'AWS Cognito (Amplify)', url: '/guides/auth/third-party/aws-cognito' },","         { name: 'WorkOS', url: '/guides/auth/third-party/workos' },","+        { name: 'Custom OIDC', url: '/guides/auth/third-party/custom-oidc' },","       ],","     },","     {"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"apps/docs/content/guides/auth/third-party/custom-oidc.mdx","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,109 @@","+---","+id: 'auth-third-party-custom-oidc'","+title: 'Custom OIDC provider'","+subtitle: 'Use any OIDC-compliant identity provider with your Supabase project'","+---","+","+Any identity provider that supports OpenID Connect (OIDC) can be used as a third-party authentication provider alongside Supabase Auth, or standalone, with your Supabase project. Use this guide for a provider that is not in the list of [supported providers](/docs/guides/auth/third-party/overview).","+","+## Getting started","+","+1. Check that your provider meets the [requirements](#requirements).","+2. Add a Third-Party Auth integration with your provider's issuer URL in the [Dashboard](#add-the-integration-in-the-dashboard) or with the [Management API](#add-the-integration-with-the-management-api).","+3. Add the `role` claim to the JWTs your provider issues.","+4. Set up the Supabase client in your application.","+","+## Requirements","+","+Your provider must meet the [limitations](/docs/guides/auth/third-party/overview#limitations) of third-party auth:","+","+1. It exposes an OIDC Issuer Discovery URL, served at `<issuer>/.well-known/openid-configuration`.","+2. It signs JWTs with an asymmetric key and includes a `kid` header parameter. Symmetrically signed JWTs, such as HS256, are not supported.","+3. Its JWTs contain a `role` claim. See [Assign the role claim](#assign-the-role-claim).","+","+The issuer URL must use HTTPS. Your project reads the signing keys from the `jwks_uri` listed in the discovery document.","+","+## Add the integration in the Dashboard","+","+1. In the Dashboard, go to **Authentication** > **Sign In / Providers** > [**Third-Party Auth**](/dashboard/project/_/auth/third-party).","+2. Click **Add provider** and select **Custom OIDC**.","+3. Enter your provider's issuer URL in **Issuer URL**, for example `https://login.example.com`.","+4. Click **Add provider**.","+","+The provider appears in the Third-Party Auth list with its issuer URL. To remove it, delete it from the same list.","+","+## Add the integration with the Management API","+","+Create a [personal access token](/docs/guides/platform/personal-access-tokens), then call the [create third-party auth integration](/docs/reference/api/v1-create-project-tpa-integration) endpoint with your provider's issuer URL in the `oidc_issuer_url` field. To list or remove integrations, use the [list](/docs/reference/api/v1-list-project-tpa-integrations) and [delete](/docs/reference/api/v1-delete-project-tpa-integration) endpoints.","+","+## Supabase CLI","+","+Custom OIDC providers are not available in the Supabase CLI. There is no `supabase/config.toml` option for them.","+","+## Assign the role claim","+","+Your Supabase project inspects the `role` claim in every JWT sent to it, to assign the correct Postgres role when using the Data API, Storage or Realtime authorization. Without a `role` claim, requests run as the `anon` role.","+","+Set `role` to `authenticated` for signed-in users. Use your provider's custom claims or token template feature to add it. See your provider's documentation for the steps.","+","+## Set up the Supabase client library","+","+Pass an `accessToken` async function that returns your provider's JWT for the current user, or `null` if there is no signed-in user:","+","+```typescript","+import { createClient } from '@supabase/supabase-js'","+","+const supabase = createClient(","+  'https://<supabase-project>.supabase.co',","+  'SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY',","+  {","+    accessToken: async () => {","+      return getAccessTokenFromYourProvider()","+    },","+  }","+)","+```","+","+Replace `getAccessTokenFromYourProvider` with the call your provider's SDK offers to get the current user's JWT.","+","+## Using RLS policies","+","+After the client sends your provider's JWT, use RLS policies to secure access to your project's database, Storage objects and Realtime channels.","+","+### Identify the user","+","+The `sub` claim identifies the user. `auth.uid()` casts `sub` to `uuid`, so it fails if your provider issues subjects that are not UUIDs. Read the claim directly instead:","+","+```sql","+create policy \"Users can read their own rows\"","+  on table_name","+  for select","+  to authenticated","+  using (user_id = (select auth.jwt()->>'sub'));","+```","+","+Here `user_id` must be a `text` column.","+","+### Restrict access by issuer","+","+Your project trusts every issuer you add, and `sub` values from different issuers can collide. If you use more than one issuer, or you also use Supabase Auth, add a restrictive policy that checks the `iss` claim:","+","+```sql","+create policy \"Restrict access to trusted issuers\"","+  on table_name","+  as restrictive","+  to authenticated","+  using (","+    (auth.jwt()->>'iss' = 'https://<project-ref>.supabase.co/auth/v1')","+    or","+    (auth.jwt()->>'iss' = 'https://login.example.com')","+  );","+```","+","+<Admonition type=\"danger\">","+","+Postgres has two types of policies: permissive and restrictive. This example uses a restrictive policy, so make sure you don't omit the `as restrictive` clause.","+","+</Admonition>","+","+For more on restrictive policies and on sharing the check across tables, Storage and Realtime, see the [Firebase Auth guide](/docs/guides/auth/third-party/firebase-auth#adding-an-extra-layer-of-security-to-your-projects-rls-policies-self-hosting-only)."],"additions":109,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"apps/docs/content/guides/auth/third-party/overview.mdx","lines":["@@ -11,6 +11,7 @@ Supabase has first-class support for these third-party authentication providers:"," - [Auth0](/docs/guides/auth/third-party/auth0)"," - [AWS Cognito (with or without AWS Amplify)](/docs/guides/auth/third-party/aws-cognito)"," - [WorkOS](/docs/guides/auth/third-party/workos)","+- [Custom OIDC provider](/docs/guides/auth/third-party/custom-oidc), for any other provider that supports OpenID Connect"," "," You can use these providers alongside Supabase Auth, or on their own, to access the [Data API (REST and GraphQL)](/docs/guides/database/overview), [Storage](/docs/guides/storage), [Realtime](/docs/guides/storage) and [Functions](/docs/guides/functions) from your existing apps."," "],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"apps/studio/components/interfaces/Auth/ThirdPartyAuthForm/AddIntegrationDropdown.tsx","lines":["@@ -70,6 +70,7 @@ export const AddIntegrationDropdown = ({","         <ProviderDropdownItem type=\"workos\" onSelectIntegrationType={onSelectIntegrationType} />","         <ProviderDropdownItem type=\"auth0\" onSelectIntegrationType={onSelectIntegrationType} />","         <ProviderDropdownItem type=\"awsCognito\" onSelectIntegrationType={onSelectIntegrationType} />","+        <ProviderDropdownItem type=\"custom\" onSelectIntegrationType={onSelectIntegrationType} />","       </DropdownMenuContent>","     </DropdownMenu>","   )"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"apps/studio/components/interfaces/Auth/ThirdPartyAuthForm/CreateCustomOidcDialog.test.tsx","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,96 @@","+import { fireEvent, screen, waitFor } from '@testing-library/react'","+import userEvent from '@testing-library/user-event'","+import { mockAnimationsApi } from 'jsdom-testing-mocks'","+import { HttpResponse } from 'msw'","+import { describe, expect, test, vi } from 'vitest'","+","+import { CreateCustomOidcIntegrationDialog } from './CreateCustomOidcDialog'","+import { customRender } from '@/tests/lib/custom-render'","+import { addAPIMock } from '@/tests/lib/msw'","+","+mockAnimationsApi()","+","+const ISSUER_PLACEHOLDER = 'https://login.example.com'","+","+const mockCreateIntegration = (requests: unknown[], response?: () => Response) => {","+  addAPIMock({","+    method: 'post',","+    path: '/v1/projects/:ref/config/auth/third-party-auth',","+    response:","+      response ??","+      (async ({ request }) => {","+        requests.push(await request.json())","+        return HttpResponse.json({","+          id: '00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000',","+          type: 'oidc',","+          oidc_issuer_url: 'https://login.example.com',","+          inserted_at: '2026-01-01T00:00:00Z',","+          updated_at: '2026-01-01T00:00:00Z',","+        })","+      }),","+  })","+}","+","+const renderDialog = () => {","+  const onClose = vi.fn()","+  customRender(<CreateCustomOidcIntegrationDialog visible onClose={onClose} />)","+  return { onClose }","+}","+","+describe('CreateCustomOidcIntegrationDialog', () => {","+  test('rejects a non-HTTPS issuer URL without calling the API', async () => {","+    const requests: unknown[] = []","+    mockCreateIntegration(requests)","+    const { onClose } = renderDialog()","+","+    await userEvent.type(","+      screen.getByPlaceholderText(ISSUER_PLACEHOLDER),","+      'http://login.example.com'","+    )","+    fireEvent.click(await screen.findByRole('button', { name: 'Add provider' }))","+","+    expect(await screen.findByText(/Enter an HTTPS URL/)).toBeInTheDocument()","+    expect(requests).toEqual([])","+    expect(onClose).not.toHaveBeenCalled()","+  })","+","+  test('requires an issuer URL', async () => {","+    renderDialog()","+","+    fireEvent.click(await screen.findByRole('button', { name: 'Add provider' }))","+","+    expect(await screen.findByText('Issuer URL is required')).toBeInTheDocument()","+  })","+","+  test('trims whitespace, sends the issuer URL as typed, and closes on success', async () => {","+    const requests: unknown[] = []","+    mockCreateIntegration(requests)","+    const { onClose } = renderDialog()","+","+    await userEvent.type(","+      screen.getByPlaceholderText(ISSUER_PLACEHOLDER),","+      '  https://login.example.com/tenant/  '","+    )","+    fireEvent.click(await screen.findByRole('button', { name: 'Add provider' }))","+","+    await waitFor(() => expect(onClose).toHaveBeenCalledOnce())","+    expect(requests).toEqual([{ oidc_issuer_url: 'https://login.example.com/tenant/' }])","+  })","+","+  test('keeps the dialog open when the API rejects the issuer', async () => {","+    mockCreateIntegration([], () =>","+      HttpResponse.json({ message: 'Unable to fetch OIDC configuration' }, { status: 400 })","+    )","+    const { onClose } = renderDialog()","+","+    await userEvent.type(","+      screen.getByPlaceholderText(ISSUER_PLACEHOLDER),","+      'https://login.example.com'","+    )","+    const submit = await screen.findByRole('button', { name: 'Add provider' })","+    fireEvent.click(submit)","+","+    await waitFor(() => expect(submit).not.toBeDisabled())","+    expect(onClose).not.toHaveBeenCalled()","+  })","+})"],"additions":96,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"apps/studio/components/interfaces/Auth/ThirdPartyAuthForm/CreateCustomOidcDialog.tsx","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,122 @@","+import { zodResolver } from '@hookform/resolvers/zod'","+import { useParams } from 'common'","+import { SubmitHandler, useForm } from 'react-hook-form'","+import { toast } from 'sonner'","+import {","+  Button,","+  Dialog,","+  DialogContent,","+  DialogFooter,","+  DialogHeader,","+  DialogSection,","+  DialogTitle,","+  Form,","+  FormControl,","+  FormField,","+  Input,","+  Separator,","+} from 'ui'","+import { FormItemLayout } from 'ui-patterns/form/FormItemLayout/FormItemLayout'","+import * as z from 'zod'","+","+import { isValidOidcIssuerUrl } from './ThirdPartyAuthForm.utils'","+import { useCreateThirdPartyAuthIntegrationMutation } from '@/data/third-party-auth/integration-create-mutation'","+","+interface CreateCustomOidcIntegrationDialogProps {","+  visible: boolean","+  onClose: () => void","+}","+","+const FORM_ID = 'create-custom-oidc-integration-form'","+","+const FormSchema = z.object({","+  issuerUrl: z","+    .string()","+    .trim()","+    .min(1, 'Issuer URL is required')","+    .refine(isValidOidcIssuerUrl, 'Enter an HTTPS URL without a query string or fragment'),","+})","+type FormValues = z.infer<typeof FormSchema>","+","+const defaultValues: FormValues = { issuerUrl: '' }","+","+export const CreateCustomOidcIntegrationDialog = ({","+  visible,","+  onClose,","+}: CreateCustomOidcIntegrationDialogProps) => {","+  const { ref: projectRef } = useParams()","+","+  const form = useForm<FormValues>({","+    resolver: zodResolver(FormSchema),","+    defaultValues,","+  })","+","+  const handleClose = () => {","+    form.reset(defaultValues)","+    onClose()","+  }","+","+  const { mutate: createAuthIntegration, isPending } = useCreateThirdPartyAuthIntegrationMutation({","+    onSuccess: () => {","+      toast.success('Custom OIDC provider added')","+      handleClose()","+    },","+  })","+","+  const onSubmit: SubmitHandler<FormValues> = (values) => {","+    createAuthIntegration({ projectRef: projectRef!, oidcIssuerUrl: values.issuerUrl })","+  }","+","+  return (","+    <Dialog open={visible} onOpenChange={(open) => !open && handleClose()}>","+      <DialogContent>","+        <DialogHeader>","+          <DialogTitle className=\"truncate\">Add custom OIDC provider</DialogTitle>","+        </DialogHeader>","+        <Separator />","+        <DialogSection>","+          <Form {...form}>","+            <form id={FORM_ID} onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-4\">","+              <p className=\"text-sm text-foreground-light\">","+                Accept JWTs from any OpenID Connect (OIDC) provider.","+              </p>","+              <FormField","+                control={form.control}","+                name=\"issuerUrl\"","+                render={({ field }) => (","+                  <FormItemLayout","+                    label=\"Issuer URL\"","+                    description={","+                      <>","+                        Signing keys are found at the issuer's{' '}","+                        <code className=\"text-code-inline\">/.well-known/openid-configuration</code>","+                      </>","+                    }","+                  >","+                    <FormControl>","+                      <Input {...field} placeholder=\"https://login.example.com\" />","+                    </FormControl>","+                  </FormItemLayout>","+                )}","+              />","+            </form>","+          </Form>","+        </DialogSection>","+        <DialogFooter>","+          <Button disabled={isPending} onClick={handleClose}>","+            Cancel","+          </Button>","+          <Button","+            variant=\"primary\"","+            form={FORM_ID}","+            type=\"submit\"","+            disabled={isPending}","+            loading={isPending}","+          >","+            Add provider","+          </Button>","+        </DialogFooter>","+      </DialogContent>","+    </Dialog>","+  )","+}"],"additions":122,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"apps/studio/components/interfaces/Auth/ThirdPartyAuthForm/IntegrationCard.tsx","lines":["@@ -98,7 +98,19 @@ export const getIntegrationTypeDescription = (type: INTEGRATION_TYPES) => {"," ","     case 'custom':","     default:","-      return 'Custom'","+      return (","+        <>","+          Allow users to use Supabase with any OpenID Connect (OIDC) provider. You can read more in","+          the{' '}","+          <a","+            className=\"hover:decoration-primary underline hover:text-foreground transition\"","+            href={`${DOCS_URL}/guides/auth/third-party/overview`}","+          >","+            documentation","+          </a>","+          .","+        </>","+      )","   }"," }"," ","@@ -170,7 +182,12 @@ export const IntegrationTypeContent = ({"," ","     case 'custom':","     default:","-      return <>Custom</>","+      return (","+        <div className=\"text-sm flex flex-row gap-x-4\">","+          <span className=\"text-foreground-light w-36\">Issuer URL</span>","+          <span className=\"text-foreground break-all\">{integration?.oidc_issuer_url ?? ''}</span>","+        </div>","+      )","   }"," }"," ","@@ -179,11 +196,7 @@ export const IntegrationCard = ({","   canUpdateConfig,","   onDelete,"," }: IntegrationCardProps) => {","-  let type = getIntegrationType(integration)","-","-  if (type === 'custom') {","-    return null","-  }","+  const type = getIntegrationType(integration)"," ","   return (","     <>"],"additions":20,"deletions":7,"truncated":false},{"path":"apps/studio/components/interfaces/Auth/ThirdPartyAuthForm/ThirdPartyAuthForm.utils.test.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,61 @@","+import { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest'","+","+import {","+  getIntegrationType,","+  getIntegrationTypeLabel,","+  isValidOidcIssuerUrl,","+} from './ThirdPartyAuthForm.utils'","+import type { ThirdPartyAuthIntegration } from '@/data/third-party-auth/integrations-query'","+","+const buildIntegration = (oidcIssuerUrl: string): ThirdPartyAuthIntegration => ({","+  id: '00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000',","+  type: 'oidc',","+  oidc_issuer_url: oidcIssuerUrl,","+  inserted_at: '2026-01-01T00:00:00Z',","+  updated_at: '2026-01-01T00:00:00Z',","+})","+","+describe('isValidOidcIssuerUrl', () => {","+  it.each([","+    'https://login.example.com',","+    'https://login.example.com/',","+    'https://example.com/realms/my-realm',","+    'https://login.example.com:8443/tenant',","+  ])('accepts %s', (value) => {","+    expect(isValidOidcIssuerUrl(value)).toBe(true)","+  })","+","+  it.each([","+    '',","+    'login.example.com',","+    'http://login.example.com',","+    'ftp://login.example.com',","+    'https://',","+    'https://login.example.com?tenant=a',","+    'https://login.example.com/#fragment',","+    'https://user:pass@login.example.com',","+    'not a url',","+  ])('rejects %j', (value) => {","+    expect(isValidOidcIssuerUrl(value)).toBe(false)","+  })","+})","+","+describe('getIntegrationType', () => {","+  it('detects known providers from the issuer URL', () => {","+    expect(getIntegrationType(buildIntegration('https://securetoken.google.com/my-project'))).toBe(","+      'firebase'","+    )","+    expect(getIntegrationType(buildIntegration('https://acme.auth0.com'))).toBe('auth0')","+  })","+","+  it('falls back to custom for any other issuer', () => {","+    expect(getIntegrationType(buildIntegration('https://login.example.com'))).toBe('custom')","+    expect(getIntegrationType(undefined)).toBe('custom')","+  })","+})","+","+describe('getIntegrationTypeLabel', () => {","+  it('labels custom issuers as Custom OIDC', () => {","+    expect(getIntegrationTypeLabel('custom')).toBe('Custom OIDC')","+  })","+})"],"additions":61,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"apps/studio/components/interfaces/Auth/ThirdPartyAuthForm/ThirdPartyAuthForm.utils.ts","lines":["@@ -53,7 +53,7 @@ export const getIntegrationTypeLabel = (type: INTEGRATION_TYPES) => {","       return 'WorkOS'","     case 'custom':","     default:","-      return 'Custom'","+      return 'Custom OIDC'","   }"," }"," ","@@ -69,9 +69,19 @@ export const getIntegrationTypeIcon = (type: INTEGRATION_TYPES) => {","       return `${BASE_PATH}/img/icons/clerk-icon.svg`","     case 'workos':","       return `${BASE_PATH}/img/icons/workos-icon.svg`","-","     case 'custom':","     default:","-      return `${BASE_PATH}/img/icons/cognito-icon.svg`","+      return `${BASE_PATH}/img/icons/badge-check-icon.svg`","+  }","+}","+","+export const isValidOidcIssuerUrl = (value: string) => {","+  if (value.includes('?') || value.includes('#')) return false","+","+  try {","+    const url = new URL(value)","+    return url.protocol === 'https:' && url.hostname.length > 0 && !url.username && !url.password","+  } catch {","+    return false","   }"," }"],"additions":13,"deletions":3,"truncated":false},{"path":"apps/studio/components/interfaces/Auth/ThirdPartyAuthForm/index.tsx","lines":["@@ -21,6 +21,7 @@ import { AddIntegrationDropdown } from './AddIntegrationDropdown'"," import { CreateAuth0IntegrationDialog } from './CreateAuth0Dialog'"," import { CreateAwsCognitoAuthIntegrationDialog } from './CreateAwsCognitoAuthDialog'"," import { CreateClerkAuthIntegrationDialog } from './CreateClerkAuthDialog'","+import { CreateCustomOidcIntegrationDialog } from './CreateCustomOidcDialog'"," import { CreateFirebaseAuthIntegrationDialog } from './CreateFirebaseAuthDialog'"," import { CreateWorkOSIntegrationDialog } from './CreateWorkOSDialog'"," import { IntegrationCard } from './IntegrationCard'","@@ -172,6 +173,11 @@ export const ThirdPartyAuthForm = () => {","           onClose={() => setSelectedIntegration(undefined)}","         />"," ","+        <CreateCustomOidcIntegrationDialog","+          visible={selectedIntegration === 'custom'}","+          onClose={() => setSelectedIntegration(undefined)}","+        />","+","         <ConfirmationModal","           size=\"medium\"","           visible={!!selectedIntegrationForDeletion}"],"additions":6,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"apps/studio/public/img/icons/badge-check-icon.svg","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1 @@","+<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"gray\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check-icon lucide-badge-check\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"/><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"/></svg>",""],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false}],"additions":431,"deletions":10,"truncated":false,"file_count":11},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-10-15T13:21:55.857456+00:00"}